Výchozí `keep` · standardy: perCs `[perLine, fill]`, psr12 `[perLine, fill]`, nette `[perLine, fill]`, symfony `keep`, laravel `keep` .[decision-facts]


multiline.operatorPosition.bitwise
==================================

Where `|`, `&`, `^`, `<<` and `>>` stand at a line break.

- `lineStart`: one ending a line opens the next, unless a comment follows it
- `lineEnd`: one opening a line ends the one before, unless a comment precedes it
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

